  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after coastal community of Gulf Harbour, this 325sqm freehold section at 5 The Rise offers an exceptional opportunity to secure your place in one of Auckland’s most desirable lifestyle locations.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re planning your first home, a stylish downsizer, or a smart investment build, this easy-care site provides the perfect foundation to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n\r\n• Freehold 325sqm section\r\n• Peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood\r\n• Close to marina, beaches, and coastal walkways\r\n• Minutes to Gulf Harbour shops, cafes, and amenities\r\n• Zoned for quality local schools\r\n• Easy access to ferry services to Auckland CBD\r\n\r\nEnjoy the relaxed seaside lifestyle while staying connected to the city. With sections in Gulf Harbour becoming increasingly scarce, this is your chance to secure land and design a home tailored exactly to your needs.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a site visit. Start building your future at 5 The Rise, Gulf Harbour.",
